BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Toronto SUP, Kayak & Canoe
UID:event_315255476@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260805T032051Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260807T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260807T193000
SUMMARY:Music on the River (ft. Jeannie Laws)
DESCRIPTION:Toronto SUP\, Kayak & Canoe Adventures - Meetup Group\nJoin us
  in jamming with artist Jeannie Laws! To book your spot\, please go to the
  link:\n*[https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/music-shows-on-the-r
 iver/](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/music-shows-on-the-rive
 r/)*\nLink shows live boat availability and options!\n\nLocated on Toronto
 ’s beautiful Humber River our Music On The River event starts at our Hum
 ber Paddling centre which is only a 5-Minute walk from Old Mill TTC Statio
 n! Upon arrival we’ll get you signed in and set you up with your boat an
 d equipment before you embark on your scenic paddle of the meandering Humb
 er River before enjoying a 45-Minute set from Popular Local Toronto Artist
 s!\n\n***Events are subject to weather and other factors out of our contro
 l. If we must cancel or delay an event we will let you know as soon as pos
 sible.***\n\n**Booking and Pricing:**\n[https://torontoadventures.ca/all-a
 dventures/music-shows-on-the-river/](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adve
 ntures/music-shows-on-the-river/)\nSingle Kayak (seats 1 person) : $49.95 
 +taxes\nTandem Kayak (seats 2 people) : $89.95 +taxes\nRegular Canoe (seat
 s 2 people) : $79.95 +taxes\nLarge Canoe (seats 3 people) : $99.95 +taxes\
 nStand Up Paddleboard (1 person) : $49.95 +taxes\nBring Your Own Boat (boa
 t/equipment): $9.95 +taxes.\n\n**What's Included:**\n\n* Boat(s)\n* Paddle
 (s)\n* PFD(s) “Lifejackets”\n* A concert right on the river!\n* Our ex
 perienced staff to help you every step of the way!\n\n**What to Bring:**\n
 \n* Dress for the weather!\n* Sunscreen\, Sunglasses & Hats\, are all reco
 mmended for sunny days!\n* We recommend securely fastened footwear (footwe
 ar is not required for SUPs).\n* Blanket to keep you cozy during the show\
 n* Snacks & Drinks (Non Alcoholic)\n* Don’t forget your Cameras!\n\n**[G
 oogle Link Directions](https://torontoadventures.ca/directions/#humberrive
 rlocation)**\n**[Cancellation Policy](https://torontoadventures.ca/faq/#ca
 ncellation)**[ ](https://torontoadventures.ca/faq/#cancellation)\n\nWe hop
 e to see you out on the water!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/torontoadventurers/events/315255476/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260614T143536Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260614T143536Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
