BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Toronto SUP, Kayak & Canoe
UID:event_315255542@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260805T032051Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260813T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260813T213000
SUMMARY:A Guided Glow in the Dark Paddle! 
DESCRIPTION:Toronto SUP\, Kayak & Canoe Adventures - Meetup Group\nJoin ou
 r guided\, Glow-In-The-Dark Paddle event! Use the following link to book y
 our spot on our Voyageur Canoe: [https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventur
 es/glow-in-the-dark-guided-tour/](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventu
 res/glow-in-the-dark-guided-tour/)\n\nGlide through the shimmering waters 
 of the Humber River in our illuminated Voyageur Canoe. The 11-seater canoe
  is setup with SUBMRG’s Under Glow Lighting System\, which casts a halo 
 of light all around the boat as the group paddles. Our experienced guides 
 will take you on a 1.5-hour tour of some of the coolest spots on the Humbe
 r!\n\n*Events are subject to weather and other factors out of our control.
  If we must cancel or delay an event we will those booked on the torontoad
 ventures.ca website know as soon as possible.*\n\n**Pricing (per seat)\, P
 ayable online through:**[https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/glow-
 in-the-dark-guided-tour/](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/glow
 -in-the-dark-guided-tour/)\n\n* Voyageur Canoe: $49.95+tax (per seat)\n\n*
 *What's Included:**\n\n* Seat on the Voyageur Canoe\n* Paddle\n* PFD(s) 
 “Lifejackets”\n* SUBMRG Under Glow Lighting\n* 1.5-Hour Guided Night P
 addle of Toronto’s Humber River!\n* Our experienced staff to help you ev
 ery step of the way!\n\n**What to Bring:**\n\n* Dress for the weather!\n* 
 We recommend securely fastened footwear (footwear is not required for SUPs
 ).\n* It gets cooler at night so bring an extra layer.\n* Government Issue
 d Photo ID.\n\n**More Information:**\n\n* We Start & Finish this event at 
 our Humber Location\, so no need for a shuttle.\n* Please plan to arrive a
 t least 15 minutes early for Check-In to ensure the entire group can begin
  and embark on the tour on time.\n* Waivers to be signed on location.\n* P
 addlers must be comfortable treading water while wearing a PFD and reachin
 g a shoreline (minimum 20 metres to shore)\n\n**[Google Link Directions](h
 ttps://www.google.ca/maps/dir//Toronto+Adventures:+Humber+River+Paddling+C
 entre\,+9+Old+Mill+Rd\,+Etobicoke\,+ON+M8X+0A5/@43.6493249\,-79.4923631\,1
 5z/data=!4m9!4m8!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x882b36600580f343:0x299b832aaa564814!2m2!1
 d-79.4923631!2d43.6493249!3e0)**\n**[Cancellation Policy](https://torontoa
 dventures.ca/faq/#cancellation)**\n\nWe hope to see you out on the water!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/torontoadventurers/events/315255542/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260614T144134Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260614T144134Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
