BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Toronto SUP, Kayak & Canoe
UID:event_315255685@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260805T032051Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260828T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260828T213000
SUMMARY:Full Moon Guided Night Tour - Join us on our Full Moon Night Paddl
 es! 
DESCRIPTION:Toronto SUP\, Kayak & Canoe Adventures - Meetup Group\n**Join 
 us on our Full Moon Night Paddle event!** Use the following link to book y
 our spot on our Full Moon Guided Night Tour: [https://torontoadventures.ca
 /all-adventures/full-moon-guided-tour/](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-a
 dventures/full-moon-guided-tour/)\n\nSee Toronto’s Humber River like you
 ’ve never seen it before!\n\nEnter Toronto’s calm\, meandering Humber 
 River at King’s Mill Park North. We paddle down as the full moon guides 
 our way to the mouth of Lake Ontario and towards a beautiful view of Toron
 to’s skyline! We will have staff on the water in their own safety boats 
 during this night time paddle!\n\n*Events are subject to weather and other
  factors out of our control. If we must cancel or delay an event we will t
 hose booked on the [torontoadventures.ca](http://torontoadventures.ca/) we
 bsite know as soon as possible.*\n\n**Pricing (per seat)\, Payable online 
 through:** [https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/full-moon-guided-t
 our/](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/full-moon-guided-tour/)\
 nSingle Kayak (seats 1 person) : $64.95 +taxes\nTandem Kayak (seats 2 peop
 le) : $99.95 +taxes\nRegular Canoe (seats 2 people) : $89.95 +taxes\nLarge
  Canoe (seats 3 people) : $99.95 +taxes\nVoyageur Group (Per person) : $54
 .95 +taxes\n\n**What's Included:**\n\n* Boat(s)\n* Paddle(s)\n* PFD(s)/ "L
 ife Jacket(s)”\n* Coast Guard Safety Kit.\n* Our friendly staff to help 
 you every step of the way!\n\n**What to Bring:**\n\n* Dress for the weathe
 r!\n* We recommend securely fastened footwear (footwear is not required fo
 r SUPs).\n* It gets cooler at night so bring an extra layer!\n* A water bo
 ttle\n* Government Issued Photo ID.\n\n**More Information:**\n\n* Anyone u
 nder 18 must be accompanied on the water by an adult or legal guardian.\n*
  Waivers Mandatory – sign the online waiver (available through order con
 firmation) for each attendee.\n* We Start & Finish this event at our Humbe
 r Location\, so no need for a shuttle.\n* Please arrive at least 15 minute
 s early for Check-In to ensure that you get out on time and can paddle for
  the full 2 hours.\n* Paddlers must be comfortable treading water while we
 aring a PFD and reaching a shoreline (minimum 20 metres to shore).\n\n**[G
 oogle Link Directions](https://torontoadventures.ca/directions/#humberrive
 rlocation)**\n**[Cancellation Policy](https://torontoadventures.ca/faq/#ca
 ncellation)**\n\nWe hope to see you out on the water!
