 .95 +taxes\nTandem Kayak (seats 2 people) : $89.95 +taxes\nRegular Canoe (
 seats 2 people) : $79.95 +taxes\nLarge Canoe (seats 3 people) : $99.95 +ta
 xes\nStand Up Paddleboard (1 person) : $49.95 +taxes\nBring Your Own Boat 
 (boat/equipment): $9.95 +taxes.\n\n**What's Included:**\n\n* Boat(s)\n* Pa
 ddle(s)\n* PFD(s) “Lifejackets”\n* A concert right on the river!\n* Ou
 r experienced staff to help you every step of the way!\n\n**What to Bring:
 **\n\n* Dress for the weather!\n* Sunscreen\, Sunglasses & Hats\, are all 
 recommended for sunny days!\n* We recommend securely fastened footwear (fo
 otwear is not required for SUPs).\n* Blanket to keep you cozy during the s
 how\n* Snacks & Drinks (Non Alcoholic)\n* Don’t forget your Cameras!\n\n
 **[Google Link Directions](https://torontoadventures.ca/directions/#humber
